			"notes": "## 🎉 Hypnosia Visuals 0.9 Beta\n\n### What's New\n\n- **V2 Home Menu** — fully redesigned UI with spring animations, module grid, and expandable settings drawer (Right Shift).\n- **Image Rendering** — display custom static images and animated GIFs in-game with chroma key, scaling, and positioning.\n- **Discord RPC** — GIF icon in status, Profile button, ID and nickname display, auto-update on name change.\n- **Cloud Configs** — upload/download configs to Hypnosia Cloud with role-based image limits.\n- **Profile System** — profile page on [nachosia.site](https://nachosia.site) with activity tracking, roles, and gradients.\n- **QoL Improvements** — Ctrl+V paste in all input fields, scale slider safeguards, no image duplication on drawer close.\n\n### Required Mods\n\n- Minecraft **1.21.11**\n- Fabric Loader **>=0.19.1**\n- Fabric API **0.141.3+1.21.11**\n- Fabric Language Kotlin **>=1.13.10+kotlin.2.3.20**\n- Java **21**\n\n### Install\n\n1. Download `hypnosia-0.9-beta.jar` from the assets below.\n2. Place it in your `.minecraft/mods/` folder alongside Fabric Loader, Fabric API, and Fabric Language Kotlin.\n3. Launch Minecraft 1.21.11.\n\n### Links\n\n- Website: https://nachosia.site\n- Privacy Policy: https://nachosia.site/privacy"
		},
